- id: '2082819614233477447'
  text: "THIS GUY BUILT A $7,000 PORTFOLIO WEBSITE USING CODEX  WITHOUT WRITING A\
    \ SINGLE LINE OF CODE\n\nworkflow →\n\n→ picks one reference image from Pinterest\
    \ as the visual direction \n→ turns it into a cinematic AI video using Flow with\
    \ camera-controlled prompts \n→ converts that video into a JPG image sequence\
    \ at 30fps for scroll animation frames \n→ grabs a matching color palette and\
    \ feeds it to ChatGPT for a full design implementation plan \n→ structures everything\
    \ into assets + instructions folders \n→ loads the project into Codex, lets it\
    \ read the plan, inspect assets, and build in stages: timeline config, app shell,\
    \ canvas render + scroll engine, nav controller, testing \n→ refines with plain-text\
    \ prompts to fix gradients, font color, and card hover interactions\n\nend result:\
    \ sticky scroll timeline, smooth animations, interactive cards agency-level design,\
    \ free version of Codex"
