- id: '2099474448692977851'
  text: 'I’ve had this idea for a very long time, and today I finally brought it to
    life. Using ChatGPT Images and Claude.


    I wanted to create a website where every element feels interactive. Just like
    a small version of my desk.


    The lamp changes the mood from evening to night.

    The poster opens an About Me pop-up.

    The screen showcases a few of my artworks.

    The camera actually works like a camera.


    If you want to explore it yourself, the link is below 👇'
